# 📚 TOEIC Vocabulary - Day24

| Word | Meaning | Example |
|---|---|---|
| submit | 제출하다 | Please submit the report by Friday. |
| approve | 승인하다 | The manager approved the proposal. |
| require | 요구하다 | The position requires experience. |
